    "notes": {
        "f4000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001": {
            "x": 144,
            "y": -320,
            "width": 680,
            "height": 380,
            "content": "## Pipeline stage result\n\nCounterpart of `CI - project status -> pipeline` (Appmixer-ai/appmixer-components#2890). The stages on the OpenClaw host post their result to this flow's webhook URL, which lives root-only on the host (`/root/.openclaw/pipeline/callback.json`) — the URL is the credential.\n\n`Pipeline comment` decides the next status from the stage, its result and the pipeline state in the comment: Testing passed → Review; failed on code on a PR vero may push to → In Progress + the fix stage (at most 3 rounds, then Needs input); blocked → Needs input. Doc&Verification blocked → Needs input. Fix pushed → Testing again; Fix gave up → Needs input. Pre-release all green → stays for the merge; anything missing → Needs input.\n\n**Source of truth:** `.github/appmixer-flows/pipeline-stage-result.json` in the connectors repo."
        }
    },
